								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" >In year 2058, Earth received a large number of mysterious symbols from space. Who are they? Where are they from? And more importantly, what are they talking about?</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Message From Aliens is a sci-fi puzzle game about decoding an alien language.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >The entire game interface is written in mysterious symbols, and the only human language you can see in this game is your own notes.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858720/extras/d93a093bf7cec7c16d2d4a5607f749f0.avif?t=1793003617" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858720/extras_big/d93a093bf7cec7c16d2d4a5607f749f0.avif?t=1793003617 width=1560 height=326 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Features:  </p><p class="bb_paragraph" >1. An alien logographic writing system with over 1,000 characters, and more than 20,000 characters of game text.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >You don't need to translate everything if you want to reach the game's ending. And there is plenty of content and secret if you want to explore more.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >2. Don't be scared by the number of characters. The alien logograms are designed to be more logical and less complex than human logograms.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >3. The first chapter of this game introduces alien number system. Most of the alien texts are just equations. (Alien Carl Sagan also believes math is the universal common knowledge.)</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >And the last chapter includes alien peotry and alien joke.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >4. In-game alien-alien dictionary.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >5. This game is inspired by the novels Stories of Your Life and Contact.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >In fact, you are playing both protagonist's role, interpreting alien signals and deciphering an alien writing system.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Don't worry. Playing game will not teleport you to light-years away, or turn your understanding of time non-linear.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >6. Some scientific concepts are involved, such as gravity and water electrolysis.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >This game is not recommended for players under 15 years old.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >7. Mini-games (in alien language)</p>						</div>
					</div>
				
				
				
